WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.095
Step 1. Open the charge item definition.

1.2
00:00:03.095 --> 00:00:08.997
Under Billing, select Charge Item Definitions, and open the category that holds it.

1.3
00:00:08.997 --> 00:00:18.059
In the row of the definition, select View.

2.1
00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:24.095
Step 2. Update the details. Select Edit, change the details, and select Update.

2.2
00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:33.477
Care does not change the slug when you change the title.

3.1
00:00:33.477 --> 00:00:39.955
Step 3. Add or remove tags. Select Add Tags, search for the tag, and select it.

3.2
00:00:39.955 --> 00:00:54.536
Care saves each change at once and shows Tags updated successfully.

4.1
00:00:54.536 --> 00:01:00.044
Step 4. Retire the charge item definition. Select Delete, then Confirm.

4.2
00:01:00.044 --> 00:01:05.007
Care does not remove the definition but sets its status to Retired.

4.3
00:01:05.007 --> 00:01:10.099
Activity definitions and products that already use it keep it.
